    "notes": "User product decision: the physical wooden door leaf is door_leaf_100, dimensions are 100 × 200 × 8 cm, material is wood, defaultColor is 0xffffff, and the leaf supports user color and image overrides. It is distinct from the parent door module/composite. Parent door placement, move, rotation, snap, collision, side insertion, delete and duplicate semantics are preserved. The leaf remains selectionMode=module so panel-only glass/Lightbox/Mesh capabilities are not enabled. New project state stores child surface.itemKey; restore normalizes legacy door surface state without losing color/image overrides. No F-025/F-030 or audit remediation is included."
